  "@@x-notes": "Lumit's user-facing text, British English, the single source translation works from. Edit this file; every other app_*.arb in this folder comes back from Crowdin and is overwritten by the next sync. Voice: sentence case, calm, no exclamation marks, no emoji, glossary terms exactly (docs/01-GLOSSARY.md section 9 - layer not track, speed not velocity, Retime not time remap, export not render, playhead not CTI). Tooltips are the control's name, not a sentence about it (docs/07-UI-SPEC.md section 13.2): one or two words, never more.",
