    "description": "Calm badge at the top of an effect's card in the Effect controls panel, for an extension's effect in the project when no installed extension carries it. The id is the extension's own short id from its manifest, such as tape. The effect is kept exactly as it was saved and the layer shows its picture unchanged.",
