  "beatsNoSound": "No beats: nothing in this composition is sounding — a mute or a solo can silence the mix.",
  "@beatsNoSound": {
    "description": "One line in the status bar at the bottom of the window, after beat detection was asked for (the Audio panel's Generate button, the Timeline's more menu, or Composition > Detect beats) and the engine found no audible source to listen to. Calm, not an error: soloing a picture layer, or muting the only layer with sound, silences the whole mix. 'Mute' and 'solo' are the two layer switches of those names."
